26be|n|A white crystalline substance, NH2.CO.OC2H5, produced by the action of ammonia on ethyl carbonate. It is used somewhat in medicine as a hypnotic. By extension, any one of the series of related substances of which urethane proper is the type.	a:b1u,85,1~b1u,85,1	v:b1u,95,2~b1u,95,2	n:b1u,95,2~b1u,95,2
